<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-unstaged-files-area">
  <title>Review Modified Resources</title>
  
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>unstaged files</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>staging changes</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
    <p id="p_tpy_tny_kpb">The <uicontrol>Unstaged files</uicontrol> area lists changed resources
      that are not staged for the next commit. These resources can include modified files, new files,
      and deleted files. Review this list to decide which changes belong in the next commit.<ul
        id="ul_upy_tny_kpb">
        <li id="li_vpy_tny_kpb">To inspect a changed resource, double-click it or use
            <xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_open_in_compare_editor"><uicontrol>Open
              in compare editor</uicontrol></xref> from the context menu.</li>
        <li id="li_wpy_tny_kpb">To prepare files for commit, move them to the <xref
            href="git-addon-staged-files-area.dita#git-addon-staged-files-area" format="dita"><uicontrol>Staged
              files</uicontrol> area</xref>. You can use <xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_stage_all"><uicontrol>Stage
              all</uicontrol></xref> to stage all files, or select specific files and use <xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_stage_selected"><uicontrol>Stage
              selected</uicontrol></xref>.</li>
        <li id="li_xpy_tny_kpb">To switch between the list view and tree view, use
            <uicontrol>Switch to tree/list view</uicontrol>.</li>
        <li id="li_r2d_lnx_12c">The context menu also includes actions such as
            <xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_open"><uicontrol>Open</uicontrol></xref>,
            <xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_stage"><uicontrol>Stage</uicontrol></xref>,
            <xref
            href="git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit.dita#git-addon-actions-review-stage-commit/action_discard"><uicontrol>Discard</uicontrol></xref>,
            <xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_history"><uicontrol>Show
              history</uicontrol></xref>, <xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_blame"><uicontrol>Show
              blame</uicontrol></xref>, and <uicontrol>Show in Explorer</uicontrol>
            (<uicontrol>Show in Finder</uicontrol> on macOS).</li>
      </ul></p>
  </body>
</topic>